OL,3,GNEWSARoyal ovation for BGT farmers
OL,4,A'left choir in tears'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer who helped lead the Hawkstone
OL,7,FFarmers Choir to victory on Britain's
OL,8,FGot Talent has said singing for the
OL,9,FKing and Queen at the Royal Variety
OL,10,FPerformance was so emotional choir
OL,11,Fmembers were left in tears.
OL,13,FAndy Owens, from Marden, Herefordshire,
OL,14,Fwas among the members of the choir who
OL,15,Ftook to the stage at London's Royal
OL,16,FAlbert Hall on Friday after winning
OL,17,Fthis year's ITV talent show.
OL,19,FThe choir received a standing ovation
OL,20,Fafter performing This Is Home, their
OL,21,Fanthem celebrating British farming and
OL,22,Frural life.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
