OL,3,GNEWSARoyal ovation for BGT farmers
OL,4,A'left choir in tears'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We weren't expecting that reception,"
OL,7,FMr Owens said. "The King was clapping
OL,8,Falong and everyone was up on their
OL,9,Ffeet. We were all in tears when we came
OL,10,Foff stage."
